n)) \\\\\n&\n\\Gamma(\\text{Proj}(A),\n\\mathcal{O}_{\\text{Proj}(A)}(n))\n\\ar[ru]_-{\\theta_U}\n&\n}\n$$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-glue-relative-proj-twists}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:971a6e5fd034578e77297d7592e168e723eaf93c268dc37646dae403d4072b78", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8806a5b4a468447e6604df5a125e16cb8667e45d4d90f7eefa6dab1a0b821511", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a58f9b72792023bbd9a0d1509ded5f7a2ad1be4d65e1d995da5e8a54a13b7c51"}
