set S$", "MATH_0013": "$A = \\mathcal{A}(U)$", "MATH_0014": "$A \\to \\Gamma(\\text{Proj}(A),\n\\bigoplus_{n \\geq 0} \\mathcal{O}_{\\text{Proj}(A)}(n))$", "MATH_0015": "$\\psi$", "REF_0005": "\\ref{remark-relative-glueing-functorial}", "MATH_0016": "$\\mathbf{Z}$", "MATH_0017": "$\\mathcal{O}_{\\underline{\\text{Proj}}_S(\\mathcal{A})}$", "MATH_0018": "$\\bigoplus \\mathcal{O}_{\\underline{\\text{Proj}}_S(\\mathcal{A})}(n)$", "REF_0006": "\\ref{lemma-morphism-proj}", "MATH_0019": "$\\theta_U$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:d99fccc5f3008047e861eee7ce79dcb8f8f11c095f401154b556e4c836a72d45", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:998d32cdd2caad9c915aa24d07763b7ea3fefb975727e12f60b267aa999d94de", "source_math_hash": "sha256:0191bf99f350569c02564f218863b112cfa48fefd833f503e483d8963030b0e3"}
